ts/unit/a03-a3-gate-coverage.test.ts\r\nacceptance:\r\n  - 判据1 anomalyNonNullCount rate ≤ 20%（100 tick）+ >20% → degrade_to_default_decision：deprecation-counters 单测断言（数值门限未改）。\r\n  - 判据2 p99 ≤ 15ms：performance-budgets 断言。\r\n  - 判据3 flag-off parity：resolveAnomalyPatternForReviewer 在 featureFlags 未定义时返回 undefined（acceptance 1.8）。\r\n  - 判据4 超预算响应：degrade_to_default_decision 生效。\r\n  - A3 只增强 reviewer context，绝不单独改变 Mission 终态决策。\r\n  - 修正 spec drift：requiredTests 补入 classifier 与计数器测试；加 coverage 守卫。\r\n  - 干净候选定向测试、类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\r\nexpectedUserBehavior:\r\n  - 维护者能复核 A3 门：判据1-4 PASS，门限未改，spec requiredTests 与证据同步，A3 仍只做增强。\r\ndocs:\r\n  required: true\r\n  files:\r\n    - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a03-a3-resilience-gate.md\r\n---\r\n\r\n# A03 冻结实施边界\r\n\r\nA03 不实现新功能，只复验既有 A3 pilot 门并修正 spec drift。门限取自原 `a3-runtime-resilience-pilot.md`（anomaly rate ≤20%、p99 ≤15ms、flag-off parity、degrade_to_default_decision），**不重定义**。修正点：原 spec 的 `requiredTests` 只列 `performance-budgets.test.ts`，漏了覆盖判据1/3/4 的 `anomaly-classifier.test.ts` 与计数器测试；已补入并加 coverage 守卫。\r\n==== A03 acceptance.json ====\r\n{\r\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\r\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\r\n  \"actor\": \"codex-a03-mainline-developer\",\r\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\r\n  \"scope\": {\r\n    \"task\": \"TF-0295\",\r\n    \"packet\": \"A03\",\r\n    \"title\": \"Re-verify A3 runtime-resilience controlled pilot gate\",\r\n    \"source\": \"current-candidate unit tests (no live provider)\",\r\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\r\n    \"realHuman\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"decision\": {\r\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\r\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\r\n    \"reason\": \"All four A3 criteria map to current assertions at the original thresholds (anomaly rate <=20% + degrade_to_default_decision, p99<=15ms, flag-off parity undefined, augmentation-only). A spec requiredTests drift (only perf was listed) was fixed with a coverage guard.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"candidate\": {\r\n    \"commit\": \"fe392a70e9afbf76238a88d4e87c08b557898940\",\r\n    \"tree\": \"554e25ff62167680db796c45a8a659ebbf44d369\",\r\n    \"dirty\": false,\r\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-a03-resilience-reverify-20261013\",\r\n    \"base\": \"3c5da37a5295fb0470b1b5035a2d67e797eb9c2b\",\r\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\r\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T15:26:00.000Z\",\r\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T15:36:00.000Z\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"criteria\": {\r\n    \"criterion1_anomalyRate\": {\r\n      \"threshold\": \"anomalyNonNullCount/totalMissionTicks <= 0.20 over 100 ticks\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts (A3: anomaly rate > 20% -> violated)\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"criterion2_p99\": {\r\n      \"threshold\": \"p99 <= 15ms\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"criterion3_flagOffParity\": {\r\n      \"threshold\": \"resolveAnomalyPatternForReviewer returns undefined when featureFlags undefined\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/anomaly-classifier.test.ts (acceptance 1.8)\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"criterion4_budgetAction\": {\r\n      \"threshold\": \"rate > 20% -> degrade_to_default_decision\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"augmentationOnly\": {\r\n      \"threshold\": \"A3 only augments reviewer context; never changes the terminal Mission decision\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"spec Active pilot limits + implementation\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"specDriftFixed\": {\r\n    \"issue\": \"a3-runtime-resilience-pilot.md requiredTests listed only tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts, omitting the classifier and counter tests that cover criteria 1/3/4.\",\r\n    \"fix\": \"added tests/unit/anomaly-classifier.test.ts + tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts + openclaw_runtime/src/observability/deprecation-counters.test.ts to requiredTests; added tests/unit/a03-a3-gate-coverage.test.ts to pin the wiring.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"gates\": {\r\n    \"a3Evidence\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"vitest run anomaly-classifier.test.ts a3-deep.test.ts deprecation-counters.test.ts performance-budgets.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 4,\r\n      \"tests\": 72,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"a03Coverage\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"vitest run tests/unit/a03-a3-gate-coverage.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 1,\r\n      \"tests\": 3,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"typecheckTest\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run typecheck:test\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"lintTouched\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"eslint tests/unit/a03-a3-gate-coverage.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"harnessValidate\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a03-resilience-pilot-reverify.md\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"Spec is valid\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"harnessDryRun\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness run --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a03-resilience-pilot-reverify.md --dry-run\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"commsReplay\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:replay\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"commsCompare\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:compare\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"all PASS, 0.00% delta\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"residual\": {\r\n    \"falsePositiveSampling\": \"The false-positive review packet sampling is a runtime sampling activity; it was not fabricated inside this gate.\",\r\n    \"pilotOnly\": \"A3 stays augmentation-only; no default-on/GA, no product