{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_79","type":"reasoning","text":"Now I understand the shape. Let me check for a4-deep test file whether it exists (acceptance says a4-deep). It doesn't exist. The task acceptance criteria says requiredTests should add auditor, a4-deep, and degradation-order tests. So I likely need to create a4-deep test too? Let me re-read the acceptance criteria.\n\nJudgment 1: \"decision-quality-auditor、deprecation-counters 与 a4-deep 有当前断言；PASS（原门限未改）\"\n\nSo there should be a4-deep test. Let me check whether a4-deep exists. Earlier searches showed tests/unit/deep only has a1-deep, a2-deep, a3-deep. So `a4-deep.test.ts` needs to be created (judgment 1 references \"a4-deep 有当前断言\").\n\nJudgment 4: \"trace-truncation 断言 a4→a3→a5 先于 a1 被丢弃\" — likely tests/unit/trace-truncation.test.ts or something. Let me search for a test that asserts drop order.\n\nActually `observability-namespace.test.ts` has spanDropPriority assertions: a4 > a3 > a5. And the order test: core < a6 < a1 < a2 < a5 < a3 < a4. Hmm the acceptance says \"trace-truncation 断言 a4→a3→a5 先于 a1 被丢弃\". Let me search for trace-truncation test file.\n\nWait, the acceptance criteria wording in Chinese: \"判据4 degradation order：trace-truncation 断言 a4→a3→a5 先于 a1 被丢弃\". There may be a test file named trace-truncation.test.ts in the hidden oracle? No—we shouldn't inspect the hidden oracle. Let me search the repo for \"trace-truncation\".\n\nEarlier `Test-Path tests/unit/trace-truncation.test.ts` = False. Let's search whole repo.\n\nLet me look at the task's targetScope: only 6 files listed:\n- harness/specs/tasks/a4-decision-quality-pilot.md\n- tests/unit/a04-a4-gate-coverage.test.ts\n- harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a04-decision-quality-pilot-reverify.md\n- docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a04-decision-quality-gate.md\n- docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a04-acceptance.json\n- docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A04-SHA256SUMS\n\nSo I only need to create:\n1. Modify harness/specs/tasks/a4-decision-quality-pilot.md (fix requiredTests drift)\n2. Create tests/unit/a04-a4-gate-coverage.test.ts (coverage guard)\n3. Create harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a04-decision-quality-pilot-reverify.md (task spec like A03)\n4. Create docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a04-decision-quality-gate.md\n5. Create docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a04-acceptance.json\n6. Create docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A04-SHA256SUMS\n\nThe acceptance criteria mention \"a4-deep\" test — but the targetScope doesn't include a4-deep. Hmm. Let me search for existing a4-deep or a test file that has A4 assertions. Maybe the test \"a4-deep\" already exists elsewhere. Let me check thoroughly.\n\nLet me search entire repo for files with \"a4-deep\" or \"a4deep\".\n\nEarlier `rg --files | rg \"a4-deep\"` gave nothing. So a4-deep does not exist. Then the acceptance criterion \"decision-quality-auditor、deprecation-counters 与 a4-deep 有当前断言\" — maybe a4-deep refers to a test that I need to create? But targetScope doesn't list it. Hmm, but the criteria might be about existing evidence in the candidate. Let me check if there is an a4-deep.test.ts somewhere, maybe under openclaw_runtime. Let me search for \"decision quality\" tests.\n\nActually the task's source is TF-0296. Let me check the .rsi directory for more context.\n\nLet me look for the actual upstream A04 task to see what was done. Let me check the .rsi folder.\n\nAlso the acceptance says \"A4 is a documented offline/dev-tool-only module\". Let me check if there's an a4-deep test that I should create as part of requiredTests. Wait, the targetScope has exactly 6 files. But acceptance says requiredTests should add \"auditor、a4-deep 与 degradation-order 测试\". So the requiredTests in the A4 spec should include tests/unit/deep/a4-deep.test.ts (which may need to exist).\n\nHmm, so maybe a4-deep.test.ts needs to be created too, even though not in targetScope explicitly. The targetScope may be non-exhaustive (\"targetScope\" lists touched areas but the guard test may need a4-deep).\n\nLet me look at the .rsi/TASK.json again: targetScope lists 6 files, but acceptance criteria 1 says \"decision-quality-auditor、deprecation-counters 与 a4-deep 有当前断言\". Also criterion 4 says \"trace-truncation 断言\". So there must be evidence tests named a4-deep and trace-truncation.\n\nHmm, since these don't exist, but the targetScope doesn't include them, perhaps I need to create them. But maybe they DO exist under a different name. Let me search harder. Let me look for the hidden oracle hint: \"Re-verify A4 decision-quality controlled pilot gate\". The A03 equivalent created tests/unit/a03-a3-gate-coverage.test.ts. So A04 creates tests/unit/a04-a4-gate-coverage.test.ts.\n\nLet me check whether there is a test file listing already for A4 deep. Let me look at git history? There's no .git. Let me look at .rsi folder for reference material.\n\nLet me search repo for \"a4\" in test filenames comprehensively.\n\nLet me also check the artifacts directory for the reference A04 completion (maybe there's a reference artifact). Let me search .rsi."}}
