{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_111","type":"reasoning","text":"Now I understand the task. The task says:\n\n\"修正 spec drift：requiredTests 补入 auditor、a4-deep 与 degradation-order 测试，并加 A04 coverage 守卫。\"\n\nSo the A04 acceptance criteria reference tests that need to exist. Let me re-read the acceptance criteria:\n\n判据1: lowQualityDecisions rate ≤ 10% + >10% → degrade_to_audit_only：decision-quality-auditor、deprecation-counters 与 a4-deep 有当前断言；PASS（原门限未改）。\n\nSo we need the \"decision-quality-auditor\" test, the \"deprecation-counters\" test, and \"a4-deep\" test to have current assertions.\n\n判据2: audit coverage（shadow sampling rate = 1.0）：模块内 auditBatch 按记录数 1:1 记 audited；但生产审计 caller 按开发手册明确禁止，当前不存在生产 coverage，原 Active Pilot 生产门保持 NO-GO。\n\n判据3: budget violation response：degrade_to_audit_only 在 >10% 时触发；PASS。\n\n判据4: degradation order：trace-truncation 断言 a4→a3→a5 先于 a1 被丢弃；A4 不在生产 turn path，per-turn cumulative latency smoke 未覆盖 A4，数值延迟门保持 NOT-MEASURED/NO-GO。\n\n修正 spec drift：requiredTests 补入 auditor、a4-deep 与 degradation-order 测试，并加 A04 coverage 守卫。\n\nSo I need to:\n1. Update `harness/specs/tasks/a4-decision-quality-pilot.md` — fix requiredTests (add auditor test, a4-deep test, degradation-order test — i.e. observability-namespace.test.ts) and add spec drift notes / NO-GO residuals.\n2. Create `tests/unit/a04-a4-gate-coverage.test.ts` — the coverage guard.\n3. Create `harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a04-decision-quality-pilot-reverify.md` — the task spec.\n4. Create `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a04-decision-quality-gate.md` — the acceptance doc.\n5. Create `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a04-acceptance.json` — the machine-readable acceptance.\n6. Create `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A04-SHA256SUMS` — checksums.\n\nThe drift: the A4 spec `requiredTests` currently lists only `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts` and `tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts`. But we need to add:\n- a decision-quality-auditor test (which needs to be created? or referenced