{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_156","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"cd D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5; cat _ref-doc.md; echo \\\"======== _ref-acceptance ========\\\"; cat _ref-acceptance.json; echo \\\"======== _ref-spec ========\\\"; cat _ref-spec.md\"","aggregated_output":"# S06：记忆写入与 EffectReceipt 恢复闭环\r\n\r\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：S06（TF-0281）。真实 provider 调用：无。\r\n\r\n## 链路（intent → decision → effect receipt）\r\n\r\n- `memory-self-edit-tools.ts`（`memory_update` / `memory_forget` / `memory_strengthen`）在写入决策点调用 `recordMemoryEffect`。\r\n- `memory-effect-receipt.ts` 构建 digest-only 视图并交给注入的 RC-04 `EffectReceiptStore`（structural sink，runtime-core 不在运行时 import agents/）。\r\n- RC-04 `effect_receipts`：append-only、idempotency key 唯一、identical-content→duplicate、content-conflict→拒绝。\r\n\r\n## 语义\r\n\r\n| 情形 | outcome |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| 写入成功 | `applied` |\r\n| 写入前被拒（如 persistFact 失败，未产生副作用） | `not_applied` |\r\n| 已产生部分副作用后失败（fact 已 append 但 invalidation / supersedes relation 失败） | `unknown`（可据 `recoverability` 对账） |\r\n\r\n- idempotency key = `memory-effect:v1:<sha256(action ⋮ factId ⋮ sessionKey ⋮ runId ⋮ toolCallId)>`，**与 outcome 无关** → 重放同意图命中同一 key。\r\n- proposal 只含 `domain/action/factId(/newFactId)`，**绝不含记忆正文**；actor/effect 走 `stage1Context`。\r\n- fail-open：无 sink 或 sink 抛错都不阻断 memory 写入。\r\n\r\n## 实测（真实数据）\r\n\r\n- 真实 `EffectReceiptStore` + 真实 `RuntimeMemoryStore`：一次 `memory_update` → 恰好 1 行 receipt（`domain_executor='clawx-runtime-memory'`, `outcome='applied'`）；重放同意图 → `duplicate:true` 且返回同一 `effectReceiptId`（0 个重复 effect）。\r\n- builder 单测：key 与 outcome 无关；proposal digest-only（不含 objectSummary/subject/predicate）；unknown 原样保留不伪装 applied；fail-open。\r\n\r\n## 残余（residual）\r\n\r\n- sink 需由调用方注入（本次测试注入真实 store）；真正的生产装配点（把 RC-04 store 接到 memory 工具上下文）留给集成层，本包不接线到 agent 注册。\r\n- `memory_recall` / `memory_find_related` 是只读，不产生 effect receipt。\r\n- 不改默认自动写回、产品默认值/锁/approval；非真人证据。\r\n======== _ref-acceptance ========\r\n{\r\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\r\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\r\n  \"actor\": \"codex-s06-mainline-developer\",\r\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\r\n  \"scope\": {\r\n    \"task\": \"TF-0281\",\r\n    \"packet\": \"S06\",\r\n    \"title\": \"Memory writes correlate with the RC-04 EffectReceipt recovery loop\",\r\n    \"source\": \"real EffectReceiptStore + real RuntimeMemoryStore (no live provider)\",\r\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\r\n    \"realHuman\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"decision\": {\r\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\r\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\r\n    \"reason\": \"Memory self-edit writes now record digest-only effect receipts through the real RC-04 store: one row per write, deterministic per-intent idempotency (replay -> duplicate, 0 duplicate effects), outcome applied/not_applied/unknown preserved, fail-open. Regression 86 tests pass.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"candidate\": {\r\n    \"commit\": \"3a1e2d384710927bc13aa1e92962824a8b88b7de\",\r\n    \"tree\": \"a8a370415a67aae26f33f2a57d3a8d804f59a0a2\",\r\n    \"dirty\": false,\r\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-s06-memory-effect-receipt-20261013\",\r\n    \"base\": \"8c34f6ca3a4151bf60626447a250044bba8ac423\",\r\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\r\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T13:06:00.000Z\",\r\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T13:18:00.000Z\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"effectLoop\": {\r\n    \"module\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.ts\",\r\n    \"sink\": \"RC-04 EffectReceiptStore (structural MemoryEffectReceiptSink; runtime-core does not import agents/ at runtime)\",\r\n    \"wiredActions\": [\r\n      \"memory_update\",\r\n      \"memory_forget\",\r\n      \"memory_strengthen\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"idempotencyKey\": \"memory-effect:v1:<sha256(action|factId|sessionKey|runId|toolCallId)> - outcome-independent, so a replayed intent 